// fixture-401: registry-protocol §5.2 NORMATIVE yank clause — when EVERY
// version of a package is yanked, the enumerate-all step has zero
// candidates left after exclusion.  The existing TNG-NO-SATISFYING-VERSION
// error fires (no new slug — see spec/errors.md); unit tests in
// test_registry.py::TestYankSelection assert the message additionally
// names the yanked-but-excluded candidates and their reasons.  There is
// no --allow-yanked escape hatch (§3.2).
name "myapp"
kind "application"
deps {
    bar
}
